  "",
  "Seven years had passed since",
  "the Earth Federation fought Zeon.",
  "But this war, which wiped out",
  "over half the total population,",
  "left the Earth Sphere devastated.",
  "An Earth environment destroyed",
  "beyond all recovery",
  "The deaths of adults in their prime",
  "The breakdown of the highly",
  "advanced computer networks",
  "Chronic food shortages",
  "caused by two colony drops.",
  "Yet the Earth Federation",
  "government held that the blame",
  "for all this chaos lay with the",
  "Principality of Zeon and the Zabi",
  "family, and never changed its way",
  "of ruling space from the Earth.",
  "They ate the food grown by",
  "the people of space, kept Earth's",
  "remaining nature for themselves,",
  "and, backed by Earth Federation",
  "arms, sought to make",
  "the glory of old their own.",
  "If war did not come of this,",
  "that would be a lie.",
  "In the blink of an eye,",
  "the fires of protest flared up",
  "all across the Earth Sphere.",
  "Beyond the near-daily colony",
  "and lunar demonstrations,",
  "even sensible Earth residents",
  "took to protesting openly.",
  "First proclaimed when the Earth",
  "Federation was founded, and Zeon",
  "Deikun's ideal, the protection of",
  "the Earth remained a living thesis.",
  "That this",
  "movement against Earth supremacy",
  "had turned into armed struggle",
  "was not because people learned",
  "nothing from the One Year War",
  "or the Delaz Conflict.",
  "Because far too many",
  "people had died,",
  "in logistics, politics, economics,",
  "thought, scholarship, art...",
  "in every field there was,",
  "know-how was lost. Squabbles",
  "and quarrels that before the war",
